(7424748, 1172256, 86447, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club, Susan!<br/> <br/>Ha!<br/> <br/>I love the UP CLOSEness of this!<br/> <br/>PURRRRRfect for the challenge topic.  :D<br/> <br/>I love how you''ve captured this for the challenge!<br/> <br/>I think that... the only thing that I could recommend is a bit of contrast in the right eye.  It seems a bit "red eye"d to me.<br/> <br/>The composition is wonderful.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club, Susan! Ha! I love the UP CLOSEness of this! PURRRRRfect for the challenge topic.  :D I love how you''ve captured this for the challenge! I think that... the only thing that I could recommend is a bit of contrast in the right eye.  It seems a bit "red eye"d to me. The composition is wonderful.', '2015-12-30 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7424749, 1172225, 86447, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club, Ashutosh!<br/> <br/>I really enjoy this image of yours.<br/> <br/>It''s fresh, and exciting... and fun.<br/> <br/>Having been here a bit, I think I know why it didn''t score as well as I think it should have...  Voters here don''t like dolls and replicas of any sort in images.<br/> <br/>I don''t agree.  I like to see images such as what you''ve done here... telling a story with an image... with characters.<br/> <br/>The colors are fun and the crop is fun.<br/> <br/>Perhaps... to meet the challenge perfectly, you might have cropped the image even more closely to get a higher score.  *sigh*<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club, Ashutosh! I really enjoy this image of yours. It''s fresh, and exciting... and fun. Having been here a bit, I think I know why it didn''t score as well as I think it should have...  Voters here don''t like dolls and replicas of any sort in images. I don''t agree.  I like to see images such as what you''ve done here... telling a story with an image... with characters. The colors are fun and the crop is fun. Perhaps... to meet the challenge perfectly, you might have cropped the image even more closely to get a higher score.  *sigh* ', '2015-12-30 00:50:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7424750, 1172276, 86447, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club, Robbie!<br/> <br/>So close to a Top Ten!   <br/> <br/>I  think what held you back is not your composition... that''s wonderful.<br/> <br/>Not your colors... those are fabulous.<br/> <br/>I see a bunch of noise in your image...   It might be your processing... I''m not sure.<br/> <br/>The noise is a distraction for me as a viewer.  <br/> <br/>I totally LOVE your composition... straight on... in my face!<br/> <br/>I think the noise held back your score.<br/> <br/>*sigh*<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club, Robbie! So close to a Top Ten!    I  think what held you back is not your composition... that''s wonderful. Not your colors... those are fabulous. I see a bunch of noise in your image...   It might be your processing... I''m not sure. The noise is a distraction for me as a viewer.   I totally LOVE your composition... straight on... in my face! I think the noise held back your score. *sigh* ', '2015-12-30 00:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
