(7424787, 1172194, 181796, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> 8 for cracking me up... and also because it''s a totally effective minimalist cat. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Minimalist and post modern is my spesific style to photo, this is sharp focus Tamron 200-500 len''s, and came with nice texture in the photo. I understand my equipment good, so I can work the best finish to my photo. It is all from skill and practise.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: 8 for cracking me up... and also because it''s a totally effective minimalist cat.  Minimalist and post modern is my spesific style to photo, this is sharp focus Tamron 200-500 len''s, and came with nice texture in the photo. I understand my equipment good, so I can work the best finish to my photo. It is all from skill and practise.', '2015-12-30 08:48:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7424788, 1172194, 181796, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> I tried that once, but the glue wouldn''t stick to his bum. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You need''s a very strong glue to make horixontal cat, super glue is very efective method of this, but make sure it is not painted surface. Cat will bond easy to a stone and bricks wall with super glue.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: I tried that once, but the glue wouldn''t stick to his bum.   You need''s a very strong glue to make horixontal cat, super glue is very efective method of this, but make sure it is not painted surface. Cat will bond easy to a stone and bricks wall with super glue.', '2015-12-30 08:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
